n.com/college-football/story/_/id/50585093/ncaa-sanctions-liberty-transfer-portal-tampering","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Five-star OT Lincoln Fa'alafi commits to Notre Dame, to join 2028 class","description":"New Zealand native Lincoln Fa'alafi, ESPN's No. 8 overall prospect in the 2028 cycle, committed Tuesday to Notre Dame.","published":"2026-11-24T19:56:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50584881/notre-dame-gets-2028-commitment-ot-lincoln-faalafi","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"A timeline of Michigan athletics since 2017","description":"Warde Manuel's eventful decade in Ann Arbor has been marked by athletic successes and marred by controversy.","published":"2026-11-24T18:47:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49351177/2026-michigan-warde-manuel-athletic-department-tenure-line-investigation","type":"Story","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios in Week 13?","description":"Plenty of spots are still up for grabs entering the final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-24T18:22:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583399/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-13","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Trev Alberts told he won't be Michigan AD after agreement","description":"Trev Alberts was \"shocked and disheartened\" to be informed by the search firm representing Michigan that he will not be the Wolverines' next AD, he told ESPN.","published":"2026-11-24T23:50:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583155/attorney-trev-alberts-told-next-ad-michigan","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel and Dan Wetzel","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4870944/chris-peal","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Peal"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Chris Peal","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Peal","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:45Z","intro":"Christopher Jenkins Jardru Peal (born March 27, 2005) is an American college football cornerback for the Syracuse Orange. He previously played for the Georgia Bulldogs.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Peal attended Providence Day School in Charlotte, North Carolina. During his high school career he had 123 tackles and three interceptions on defense and rushed 246 times for 1,919 yards and caught 48 passes for 556 yards with 36 total touchdowns on offense. He committed to University of Georgia to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Peal played in five games at Georgia in 2023 and 2024. After the 2024 season, he entered the transfer portal and transferred to Syracuse University. In his first year at Syracuse in 2025, he started all 12 games and recorded 43 tackles. Peal returned to Syracuse for the 2026 season."}]}}